"Un effort à but non lucratif pour protéger les sites WordPress et les "
"personnes qui les font vivre."

#: .\templates\public\about.html:20
msgid "Who we are"
msgstr "Qui sommes-nous"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:21
msgid ""
"Louis WP Scan is a non profit project created after one too many small "
"websites were lost to attacks that were entirely preventable. WordPress "
"powers a huge part of the web, from family blogs to local shops and "
"charities. Many of these sites are run by people who are experts in their "
"own field but were never meant to become security specialists."
msgstr ""
"Louis WP Scan est un projet à but non lucratif né après la perte de trop de "
"petits sites à cause d'attaques entièrement évitables. WordPress propulse "
"une grande partie du web, des blogs familiaux aux commerces locaux et aux "
"associations. Beaucoup de ces sites sont gérés par des personnes expertes "
"dans leur domaine mais qui n'ont jamais eu vocation à devenir spécialistes "
"de la sécurité."

#: .\templates\public\about.html:22
msgid ""
"We exist to close that gap. We turn the technical checks a security "
"professional would run into a simple, friendly report that anyone can act "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Nous existons pour combler cet écart. Nous transformons les vérifications "
"techniques qu'effectuerait un professionnel de la sécurité en un rapport "
"simple et accessible sur lequel chacun peut agir."

#: .\templates\public\about.html:24
msgid "What makes us different"
msgstr "Ce qui nous distingue"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:26
msgid "Completely free, with no hidden paid tier"
msgstr "Entièrement gratuit, sans offre payante cachée"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:27
msgid "We respect your privacy and store as little as possible"
msgstr ""
"Nous respectons votre vie privée et stockons le moins de données possible"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:28
msgid "Plain language fixes, not confusing jargon"
msgstr "Des corrections en langage clair, sans jargon déroutant"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:29
msgid "Safe, read only checks that never touch your content"
msgstr ""
"Des vérifications sûres, en lecture seule, qui ne touchent jamais à votre "
"contenu"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:30
msgid "Available in English and French"
msgstr "Disponible en anglais et en français"

#: .\templates\public\about.html:37
msgid ""
"To protect small businesses and everyday people from hacking and the illegal"
" use of their data, by making practical security knowledge free for "
"everyone."
msgstr ""
"Protéger les petites entreprises et les particuliers contre le piratage et "
"l'usage illégal de leurs données, en rendant le savoir pratique en matière "
"de sécurité gratuit pour tous."

