#: .\templates\public\founding_story.html:5
msgid ""
"Why Louis WP Scan exists, and the story of the man it is named after: the "
"physicist Louis de Broglie."
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi Louis WP Scan existe, et l'histoire de l'homme dont il porte le nom"
